cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOCRE-1 in academic or applied work, please cite it as below."
title: "MOCRE-1 — Modelo Cavati de Red de Esfuerzo"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid statistical–fuzzy earthquake forecasting model. It refines an ETAS
  baseline intensity with a thin fuzzy gain (lambda = mu_ETAS * G) computed over
  physical and statistical stress-network signals — seismicity, recurrence,
  deformation, Coulomb transfer and induced-seismicity fluid pressure — and is
  benchmarked against its own null hypothesis with CSEP-style paired tests.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cavati
    given-names: Matt
    website: "https://mocre.es"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mattcavati/mocre"
url: "https://mocre.es"
keywords:
  - earthquake-forecasting
  - fuzzy-logic
  - ETAS
  - seismology
  - CSEP
  - probabilistic-forecasting
  - induced-seismicity
